I haven't talked to you enough.

714
00:29:13,334 --> 00:29:14,627
-[Christine] Okay, yeah.
-[Mary] So...

715
00:29:15,170 --> 00:29:17,422
-[Mary] Is everything fine?
-Yeah.

716
00:29:17,505 --> 00:29:18,923
Everything is not fine right now.

717
00:29:19,007 --> 00:29:21,551
I'm trying to be as cool
as a mother fucking cucumber

718
00:29:21,634 --> 00:29:23,303
in a goddamn grocery store.

719
00:29:25,597 --> 00:29:26,806
[yelling]

720
00:29:27,849 --> 00:29:29,559
[cheering]

721
00:29:30,226 --> 00:29:32,061
[Mary] That's pretty dope.
That's pretty dope.

722
00:29:32,145 --> 00:29:33,188
-[whooping]
-[Nicole] That's so dope.

723
00:29:34,981 --> 00:29:36,983
You don't look satisfied.

724
00:29:37,066 --> 00:29:38,443
[indistinct chatter]

725
00:29:38,526 --> 00:29:39,736
-I don't know.
-[Jason] Romain.

726
00:29:39,819 --> 00:29:42,572
You're making things, like, really 
awkward right now. Could you maybe...

727
00:29:42,655 --> 00:29:43,615
