what am I supposed to do?

734
00:30:01,424 --> 00:30:04,177
[Chrishell] Woo!

735
00:30:04,260 --> 00:30:08,640
No. I mean, it's just fucking Mary.
I don't know.

736
00:30:08,723 --> 00:30:13,937
♪ If you tango with the darkness
It'll steal your light ♪

737
00:30:14,354 --> 00:30:15,772
[chanting] Mary! Mary!

738
00:30:15,855 --> 00:30:23,112
♪ If you tango with the darkness
It'll steal your light ♪

739
